{"slug":"cathy-mcmorris-rodgers","qid":"Q293343","name":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers","desc":"American politician (born 1969)","article":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers","born":"1969-05-22","died":null,"birthplace":"Salem","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"WA-05","f":2005,"u":2025},{"t":"Washington House of Representatives","w":"","f":1994,"u":2005}],"summary":"Cathy Anne McMorris Rodgers (born May 22, 1969) is an American politician who served from 2005 to 2025 as the United States representative for Washington's 5th congressional district, which encompasses the eastern third of the state and includes Spokane, the state's second-largest city. A Republican, McMorris Rodgers previously served in the Washington House of Representatives. From 2013 to 2019, she chaired the House Republican Conference.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":188648,"s":59.51,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":247815,"s":61.29,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":175422,"s":54.76,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":192959,"s":59.64,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":135470,"s":60.68,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":191066,"s":61.92,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris Rodgers"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":177235,"s":63.67,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":211305,"s":65.28,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":134967,"s":56.4,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"WA-05","p":"R","v":179600,"s":59.68,"w":true,"n":"Cathy McMorris"}]}